sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User as 操作员
  participant Browser as Duck Viewer
  participant API as FastAPI 路由
  participant WS as WebSocket /ws
  participant LabLoop as 50 Hz lab_loop
  participant Duck as Duck 与环境
  participant Job as TrainingJob
  participant Trainer as train_behavior
  User->>Browser: 打开 http://127.0.0.1:63317
  Browser->>API: GET /scene
  API-->>Browser: meshes、geoms、bodies
  Browser->>API: GET /policies
  API-->>Browser: pollen、runs、checkpoints
  Browser->>WS: 建立连接
  loop 每 20 ms
    LabLoop->>Duck: 设置命令、推理、env.step
    Duck-->>LabLoop: 姿态与遥测
  end
  loop 每 2 个 tick
    LabLoop-->>WS: 以 25 Hz 产生 Frame
    WS-->>Browser: cmd、ducks、stats、training、events
  end
  User->>Browser: 分配、生成或重置
  Browser->>WS: assign、spawn_duck 或 reset
  WS->>Duck: 热切换、创建或重置
  User->>Browser: 教授行为
  Browser->>API: POST /teach
  API->>Job: 创建课程任务与预览 Duck
  Job->>Trainer: 启动含 32 个环境的子进程
  loop 配置的快照周期
    Trainer-->>Job: progress.jsonl 与原子 live.onnx
    LabLoop->>Job: 约以 1 Hz 轮询
    Job->>Duck: trainee 与 helper 热加载快照
    LabLoop-->>Browser: 含更新训练状态的 Frame
  end
